    "chunk_text": "swy\u00fee gemyndige & on eallum tidum secggan we him \u00feanc ealra his miltsa & his ea\u00f0modnessa & his geofena \u00fee he us \u00deonne forgife\u00fe he us \u00fe\u00e6t we motan to widan feore his \u00fea wuldorf\u00e6stan onsyne mid sibbe sceawian, \u00de\u00e6t is \u00fe\u00e6t wuldorf\u00e6ste lif \u00fe\u00e6tte englas, & heahenglas, & heahf\u00e6deras, & witgan & ealle halige on \u00de\u00e6r bi\u00fe a ece gefea buton unrotnesse, & geogo\u00fe buton yldo. Ne bi\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6r sar ne gewinn, ne n\u00e6nig une\u00fenes, ne sorg ne wop, ne hungor, ne \u00feurst, ne ece yfel. Ne \u00fe\u00e6r mon his feond finde\u00f0, ne his freond forl\u00e6te\u00fe. Ac \u00fe\u00e6r wunian mot se \u00fea stowe gesece\u00fe, mid engla sibbe on ecean wuldre for urum Drihtne se leofa\u00f0.",
